{"product_id":"if-you-want-breakfast-in-bed-sleep-in-the-kitchen","title":"If You Want Breakfast In Bed Sleep In The Kitchen","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis book offers a laugh-a-minute look at marriage. Husbands and wives cannot help but see themselves because the topics—communication, sex, shopping, childbirth, mammograms, prostate exams—are all common to life and are better laughed at than cried over. The author is an award-winning humor writer who sees laughter as a gift from God.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 146 x 222\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Dave Meurer\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780781441544\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 191\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45387122671769,"sku":"15RC-2-9780781441544","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68221fc045dc0_If_You_Want_Breakfast_In_Bed_Sleep_In_The_Kitchen_Dave_Meurer.jpg?v=1747151531","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/if-you-want-breakfast-in-bed-sleep-in-the-kitchen","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}